id: pack-animal
name: Pack Animal
order: 2
optionOf: beast-of-a-kind
optionEffect: 2
# "You gain the Flexible Flanker Talent" - given as it is chosen, kept as a Racial Trait's Talent is.
grantsTalent: flexible-flanker
description: >
  You gain the Flexible Flanker Talent and if 2+ Allies are within the Melee Range of an Opponent, increase your Wound Rolls against them by an additional 1(T).
text: >
  Pack Animal [Passive]: You gain the Flexible Flanker Talent and if 2+ Allies are within the Melee Range of an Opponent, increase your Wound Rolls against them by an additional 1(T).

---

[passive]
# Against that Opponent alone - 2 of your Allies, not Defeated, within their own Melee Range (chat.mjs packFlankParts).
wound.packFlank += 1(T);
